        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norwich%2C_Vermont"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Norwich once hosted a military academy founded by Alden Partridge, which later relocated to Northfield and became Norwich University.",
